<doxygen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="compound.xsd" version="1.18.0" xml:lang="en-US">
  <compounddef id="hetero" kind="page">
    <compoundname>hetero</compoundname>
    <title>Networks With Heterogeneous Agents</title>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><anchor id="hetero_1md_src_2examples_2hetero"/></para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This page assumes familiarity with the basic layout and API usage described in the main <ref refid="examples" kindref="compound">Examples</ref> page.</para>
</simplesect>
As explained in the <ref refid="nd_1hetero-dynamics" kindref="member">Heterogeneous Dynamics</ref> section, agents in a network do not necessarily need to share dynamics, noise, or discrete callback functions. Whenever any of these are distinct for any two agents, the network is said to exhibit heterogeneous dynamics. Let us modify the basic example shown in the <ref refid="multi" kindref="compound">Adding Multiple Agents</ref> section to have the three vertices instead evolve according to</para>
<para><formula id="72">\[    \frac{dx_1}{dt} = Ax_1t,
\]</formula>   <formula id="73">\[    \frac{d\vec{x}_2}{dt} = B\sin{x_2^{[1]}} - Dx_2^{[2]}\cos{t},
\]</formula>      <formula id="74">\[    \frac{dx_3}{dt} = \begin{cases}
    0 &amp; \text{if}~t &lt; 1 \\
    t &amp; \text{otherwise}
    \end{cases}
\]</formula></para>
<para>To further emphasise heterogeneity, the second vertex has a two-element state vector, and the third evolves according to a piecewise function. As before, we simply define the different equations in separate dynamics functions.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".c"><codeline><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>dyn1(<ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref>*<sp/>v1,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>dx1,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>x1,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>t,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">void</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>p)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>A<sp/>=<sp/>*(</highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*)p;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx1[0]<sp/>=<sp/>A<sp/>*<sp/>x1[0]<sp/>*<sp/>t;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>dyn2(<ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref>*<sp/>v2,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>dx2,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>x2,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>t,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">void</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>p)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>B<sp/>=<sp/>((</highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*)p)[0];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>D<sp/>=<sp/>((</highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*)p)[1];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx2[0]<sp/>=<sp/>B<sp/>*<sp/>sin(x2[0]);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx2[1]<sp/>=<sp/>-D<sp/>*<sp/>x2[1]<sp/>*<sp/>cos(t);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>dyn3(<ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref>*<sp/>v3,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>dx3,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>x3,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>t,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">void</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>p)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Piecewise<sp/>function</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(t<sp/>&gt;=<sp/>1.0)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx3[0]<sp/>=<sp/>t;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">else</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>dx3[0]<sp/>=<sp/>0.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>The network callback for writing output to a file has identical structure to what has been shown in previous examples, so we will not repeat it here. In <computeroutput>main()</computeroutput>, the vertices can either be assigned the dynamics functions as we have been doing up to now...</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".c"><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>main(</highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>argc,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">char</highlight><highlight class="normal">**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__lib__mgmt_1gaf795d2bbc114d928901bc9700830df4e" kindref="member">ndxlInit</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Create<sp/>extra<sp/>parameters<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>single<sp/>array<sp/>which<sp/>we<sp/>will<sp/>offset<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ABD[3]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>1.6,<sp/>2.3,<sp/>0.7<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Create<sp/>initial<sp/>conditions<sp/>for<sp/>vertex<sp/>1</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>x1_0<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Create<sp/>initial<sp/>conditions<sp/>for<sp/>vertex<sp/>2</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>x2_0[2]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>0.5,<sp/>0.6<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Vertex<sp/>3<sp/>shall<sp/>have<sp/>the<sp/>initial<sp/>condition<sp/>x3_0<sp/>=<sp/>0,<sp/>so<sp/>we<sp/>can<sp/>simply<sp/>pass<sp/>NULL<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>state<sp/>vector</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Technically,<sp/>we<sp/>must<sp/>then<sp/>also<sp/>pass<sp/>a<sp/>&quot;state<sp/>vector<sp/>size&quot;<sp/>of<sp/>1<sp/>to<sp/>create<sp/>a<sp/>scalar</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>However,<sp/>NDXL<sp/>enforces<sp/>a<sp/>minimum<sp/>size<sp/>of<sp/>1,<sp/>so<sp/>even<sp/>passing<sp/>0<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>length<sp/>would<sp/>give<sp/>the<sp/>desired<sp/>result</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Sine<sp/>ABD<sp/>is<sp/>already<sp/>a<sp/>double*,<sp/>we<sp/>can<sp/>use<sp/>pointer<sp/>arithmetic<sp/>to<sp/>get<sp/>the<sp/>position<sp/>in<sp/>ABD<sp/>where<sp/>the<sp/>`void*<sp/>params`<sp/>of<sp/>vertices<sp/>1<sp/>and<sp/>2<sp/>are</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__creation_1gaec4b6881830464281fc35817e96bfaf3" kindref="member">ndxlCreateVertex</ref>(nwk,<sp/>&amp;x1_0,<sp/>1,<sp/>dyn1,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>ABD);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__creation_1gaec4b6881830464281fc35817e96bfaf3" kindref="member">ndxlCreateVertex</ref>(nwk,<sp/>x2_0,<sp/>2,<sp/>dyn2,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>ABD<sp/>+<sp/>1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__creation_1gaec4b6881830464281fc35817e96bfaf3" kindref="member">ndxlCreateVertex</ref>(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>1,<sp/>dyn3,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>...or we can set the dynamics after creation using <ref refid="group__vertex__setters_1ga31a4de68771e8c0cd8e27be237aa8604" kindref="member">ndxlSetVertexDynamics</ref>. We could take this a step further, and delay initial state and <computeroutput>void* params</computeroutput> assignment until after creation as well, using <ref refid="group__vertex__functions_1ga1f59cebd8575f89020b590ba036006c8" kindref="member">ndxlVertexState</ref> and <ref refid="group__vertex__setters_1gaba1257b95725546dd745e2ce06148d8d" kindref="member">ndxlSetVertexParams</ref> to update them, respectively. The only caveat is to ensure we pass 2 for the size of vertex 2&apos;s state vector, as the size cannot be changed later.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".c"><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>main(</highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>argc,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">char</highlight><highlight class="normal">**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__lib__mgmt_1gaf795d2bbc114d928901bc9700830df4e" kindref="member">ndxlInit</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Create<sp/>three<sp/>empty,<sp/>stateless,<sp/>static<sp/>vertices</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>For<sp/>vertices<sp/>1<sp/>and<sp/>3,<sp/>a<sp/>state<sp/>size<sp/>of<sp/>0<sp/>or<sp/>1<sp/>both<sp/>result<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>zero-vector<sp/>of<sp/>length<sp/>1</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>For<sp/>vertex<sp/>2,<sp/>we<sp/>MUST<sp/>specify<sp/>the<sp/>size<sp/>to<sp/>be<sp/>2</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref>*<sp/>v1<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__creation_1gaec4b6881830464281fc35817e96bfaf3" kindref="member">ndxlCreateVertex</ref>(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref>*<sp/>v2<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__creation_1gaec4b6881830464281fc35817e96bfaf3" kindref="member">ndxlCreateVertex</ref>(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>2,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="ndxlcore_8h_1ad03a49b11a22416ba63273c4d7deb38b" kindref="member">NDXLVertex</ref>*<sp/>v3<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__creation_1gaec4b6881830464281fc35817e96bfaf3" kindref="member">ndxlCreateVertex</ref>(nwk,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>1,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>0,<sp/>NULL,<sp/>NULL);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Create<sp/>extra<sp/>parameters<sp/>and<sp/>assign<sp/>them<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>parameters<sp/>setter</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>ABD[3]<sp/>=<sp/>{<sp/>1.6,<sp/>2.3,<sp/>0.7<sp/>};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__setters_1gaba1257b95725546dd745e2ce06148d8d" kindref="member">ndxlSetVertexParams</ref>(v1,<sp/>ABD);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__setters_1gaba1257b95725546dd745e2ce06148d8d" kindref="member">ndxlSetVertexParams</ref>(v2,<sp/>ABD<sp/>+<sp/>1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Assign<sp/>initial<sp/>conditions<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>vertices<sp/>-<sp/>since<sp/>v3<sp/>has<sp/>x3_0<sp/>=<sp/>0,<sp/>we<sp/>don&apos;t<sp/>have<sp/>to<sp/>update<sp/>it<sp/>at<sp/>all!</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__functions_1ga1f59cebd8575f89020b590ba036006c8" kindref="member">ndxlVertexState</ref>(v1)[0]<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__functions_1ga1f59cebd8575f89020b590ba036006c8" kindref="member">ndxlVertexState</ref>(v2)[0]<sp/>=<sp/>0.5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__functions_1ga1f59cebd8575f89020b590ba036006c8" kindref="member">ndxlVertexState</ref>(v2)[1]<sp/>=<sp/>0.5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Assign<sp/>the<sp/>dynamics<sp/>functions</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__setters_1ga31a4de68771e8c0cd8e27be237aa8604" kindref="member">ndxlSetVertexDynamics</ref>(v1,<sp/>dyn1);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__setters_1ga31a4de68771e8c0cd8e27be237aa8604" kindref="member">ndxlSetVertexDynamics</ref>(v2,<sp/>dyn2);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__vertex__setters_1ga31a4de68771e8c0cd8e27be237aa8604" kindref="member">ndxlSetVertexDynamics</ref>(v3,<sp/>dyn3);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>We simulate the network again using the Cash-Karp integrator, with a time stop at <formula id="75">$t=1$</formula> to ensure the piecewise dynamics of <computeroutput>v3</computeroutput> transition at the appropriate time.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".c"><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>main(</highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>argc,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">char</highlight><highlight class="normal">**<sp/>argv)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__lib__mgmt_1gaf795d2bbc114d928901bc9700830df4e" kindref="member">ndxlInit</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>tstop<sp/>=<sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group__network__simulation_1ga4bbb15e23be3b5823fe6e0b572e2f7f3" kindref="member">ndxlNetworkSimulateRkck</ref>(nwk,<sp/>5.0,<sp/>1e-6,<sp/>1e-3,<sp/>&amp;tstop,<sp/>1,<sp/>cb);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
